cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. Note that it is an
  exploratory research prototype: see VALIDATION.md for which of its claims
  are supported by evidence and which are not.
title: "Geometric Optimization via E8 Lattice Structure"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype exploring optimization by geometric coherence on the E8
  root system, with a Geometric Annealing Solver and an N-to-8-dimensional
  meta-layer. The repository carries a claim register (validation/claims.json)
  and a harness that re-tests every claim it makes about itself. As of this
  version the solver has not been shown to outperform uniform random sampling.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "JinnZ2 Collaborative Research"
    website: "https://github.com/JinnZ2"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JinnZ2/geometric-optimization"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.0
keywords:
  - optimization
  - E8 lattice
  - root system
  - simulated annealing
  - geometric methods
